Notification, and shall have the power to interpret this Notification in case of any problem or
issues not specified therein. The decision or order of the President shall be final. Issued on April 9, B.E. 2563 (2020)
(Suvit Saetia)
(Asso. Prof. Dr. Suvit Saetia)
President of KMITL",90,665229464379b5d88c74ece2e349d248,pdf,110,ok
